; claude.grid - Claude Code starting up: an MCP-approval prompt on the normal screen, then the
; alternate screen for the session itself, then teardown. The acceptance corpus, and the one that
; exercises the paths the others do not: 47 truecolor SGRs, 40 mode-2026 boundaries, OSC 8, kitty
; keyboard pops and modifyOtherKeys.
;
; Audited against corpus/claude.bin on 2026-08-29, byte offsets from the recording itself.
;
; Frames 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 22 and 23 were read against the bytes in full - every SGR run matched to
; the sequence that set it, every column matched to the CUP and CUF arithmetic that placed it:
;
;   f1 (b95)   ?25l at 49 leaves the cursor hidden, [H at 29 homes it, OSC 0;claude at 32 sets both
;              names, ?2004h at 55 and ?1004h at 63 are the two modes on. [2J at 22 left it blank.
;   f2 (b1171) the MCP prompt. The 120-cell rule on r01 is bytes 114-474, exactly 360 bytes of
;              U+2500, and does not wrap because a CUP follows it. Words are separated by [1C, not
;              by spaces, so every gap cell keeps the default style - which is why s02 reads
;              "..g.ggg.ggg..." and not a solid run. [>0q at 1147 is XTVERSION, not DECSCUSR: the
;              cursor stays a blinking block. The OSC 8 at 786 and its close at 886 leave no text
;              on the screen - the URL is kept, not leaked - and r05/r06 read as the sentence
;              without it. The link is the one place the corpus exercises id=: [1C then "MCP " ends
;              r05 inside the link, [7;3H then "documentation" continues it on r06, and both runs
;              carry the same id= so h05 and h06 mark them as one link and not two.
;   f3 (b1251) ?1049h at 1243. The cursor carries into the alternate screen at col 119 row 12,
;              where 12 CR/LF pairs and the [120C at 1237 had left it. The alt buffer has no
;              history, so scrollback is 0 for every frame until it is left again.
;   f4 (b1500) OSC 0 at 1464 sets the title to U+2733 + " Claude Code" - the payload is UTF-8 and
;              is decoded as UTF-8. ?1003h and ?1006h at 1271/1279 make the mouse anyevent/sgr.
;   f5 (b2973) the banner. [48;2;0;0;0m at 1528 gives style f, and [49m at 1671 returns to style e
;              - foreground #d77757 on the default background, not to default - which is the one
;              place a truecolor background is set and cleared. r30 continues r29: the rule at
;              1869 is 360 bytes and fills r29 to column 119, so the U+276F at 2232 wraps onto the
;              next row rather than a CUP placing it there.
;   f22 (b5239) ?1049l at 5231 restores the cursor saved at f3 - col 119, row 12. The mouse is
;              already off: it was reset at 5176-5208, before the alt screen was left.
;   f23 (b5558) OSC 0; at 5531 clears both names to the empty string; ?1004l at 5550 is the last
;              mode off.
;
; The rest were checked structurally rather than cell by cell: 23 frames for the corpus's 20
; mode-2026 closes plus the two ?1049 transitions plus end of stream; offsets strictly increasing;
; every frame 120x34, matching the recording header; alt off for exactly frames 1, 2, 22 and 23;
; scrollback 0 throughout, since the normal screen is only ever addressed inside its 34 rows and
; the alternate screen has no history to keep.
;
; Rewritten after gap 14 was fixed. Before it, OSC 8 was unhandled, so there were no links or urls
; sections and r05 ended at "MCP" - the space after it is printed inside the link, which made it a
; cell holding something and no longer one the trailing-blank trim drops. The text on screen is
; unchanged; every other line of every frame is byte-identical to the previous golden.
;
; Written after gap 19 was fixed. Before it, frames 22 and 23 read "modes ... " with no autowrap:
; Terminal.RestoreCursor put back four saved modes that Terminal.SaveCursor never saved, so ?1049l
; reset DECAWM to false. corpus/claude.bin contains no DEC mode 7 anywhere, so autowrap is on in
; all 23 frames.
;
# claude  frame 1/23  after 95/5558 bytes  (sync-frame close)
size 120x34
alt off
cursor col=0 row=0 hidden shape=block blink
scrollback 0
title "claude"
icon "claude"
modes autowrap bracketed-paste focus mouse=off/x10 kitty=none
continues none
text
  r00-r33 ~blank~
style
  s00-s33 ~default~
